# Web app build settings (Phase 7C). Read at BUILD time and published in the JavaScript: never put
# a secret here. The build refuses any VITE_ variable other than VITE_API_BASE_URL.
#
# Where the API is (apps/web/src/api-base.ts). Default /api/v1: the same origin, forwarded to the
# API by the host (vercel.json, Caddy, vite dev/preview). Only for an API on a same-site
# subdomain, an absolute https URL, with the web origin in the API's VEYRA_CORS_ORIGINS:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.veyra.example.com/api/v1
